  "label": "Anti-Abortion Activism",
  "description": "A political and social movement that opposes abortion and seeks to restrict or ban it through legislation, public campaigns, and sometimes direct action. The visual of erasing 'Abortion' in the meme is a common tactic used by anti-abortion activists to symbolize the removal or rejection of abortion as a legal or moral option. This meme aligns with the messaging and visual rhetoric of this movement.",
